OL,4,                                   G1/2 
OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FThursday sees rain and cloud    
OL,8,Fsinking southwards across southern     
OL,9,FEngland and Wales, brighter further    
OL,10,Fnorth with isolated showers. In the    
OL,11,Ffar south and southwest, frequent      
OL,12,Fblustery and perhaps thundery showers  
OL,13,Fpersist. Chillier in the north, milder 
OL,14,Fin the south.                          
OL,16,GTonight:FTonight remains unsettled     
OL,17,Facross the south, with further heavy   
OL,18,Fshowers and outbreaks of rain. Clearer 
OL,19,Fskies further north, though showers    
OL,20,Fpersist along North Sea coasts,        
OL,21,Fturning wintery over Scottish hills.   
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
