OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GFriday:FA crisp, frosty and bright     
OL,8,Fstart on Friday. Showers persist along 
OL,9,FNorth Sea coast, while rain clears the 
OL,10,Fsouth through the morning. Drier       
OL,11,Felsewhere, with sunny spells. Chilly   
OL,12,Ffor most.                              
OL,14,GOutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAnother
OL,15,Ffrosty start Saturday, with sunny      
OL,16,Fspells over the weekend for many,      
OL,17,Fbefore turning wet and windy from the  
OL,18,Fwest on Monday. However, the southwest 
OL,19,Fstays damp with persistent rain.       
