OL,4,CUK 'effectively blind' to early Covid  
OL,5,Cspread due to lack of test and trace,  
OL,6,Cinquiry finds                          
OL,7,GFailings in testing and tracing left   
OL,8,Gthe UK effectively blind to how        
OL,9,Gquickly Covid was spreading early in   
OL,10,Gthe pandemic, the UK Covid Inquiry     
OL,11,Gfinds.                                 
OL,13,F"The UK was simply not prepared. Too   
OL,14,Fmany lives were cut short," the        
OL,15,Finquiry's chairwoman says.             
OL,17,FDespite British scientists developing  
OL,18,Fa highly accurate test for Covid in    
OL,19,FJanuary 2020, the government was       
OL,20,Fforced to abandon community testing in 
OL,21,FMarch 2020 at a critical moment, the   
OL,22,Finquiry says.                          
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
