OL,3,W"###"###"###T/////-,,/,,,-.-.,,-,,/////
OL,4,CTrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint      
OL,5,Cdeclaration on peace' after 90-minute  
OL,6,Ctalks in China                         
OL,7,GDonald Trump, Vladimir Putin, and Xi   
OL,8,GJinping issue a "joint declaration on  
OL,9,Gpeace" after 90-minute talks in China. 
OL,11,FThe statement says "nuclear war cannot 
OL,12,Fbe won and must never be fought" - it  
OL,13,Falso pledges to "increase the          
OL,14,Fproduction of refined petroleum        
OL,15,Fproducts".                             
OL,17,FIn footage released earlier by the     
OL,18,FKremlin of him leaving the talks,      
OL,19,FPutin says to Xi: "I don't think       
OL,20,Fanyone even expected everything to go  
OL,21,Fso well".                              
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
